#: ../../source/imperative/events.rst:2
msgid "4. Event Routing, Frame Sync, & Change Stamps"
msgstr "4. 事件路由、帧同步与变更戳"

#: ../../source/imperative/events.rst:4
msgid ""
"Imperative Xent routes normalized UI events through capture, target, and "
"bubble phases and gives you full control over how state changes coalesce "
"into visual updates."
msgstr "命令式 Xent 按捕获、目标、冒泡三阶段分发标准化 UI 事件，并让你完全掌控状态变更如何合并为界面更新。"

#: ../../source/imperative/events.rst:9
msgid "Three Ways to Subscribe to Events"
msgstr "订阅事件的三种方式"

#: ../../source/imperative/events.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Typed transaction helpers** (most common): Generated "
"``xtk_<ctrl>_on<event>`` wrappers in ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` subscribe "
"on ``XTK_EVENT_PHASE_MASK_TARGET`` while building a transaction:"
msgstr "**强类型事务订阅函数** （最常用）： ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` 生成的 ``xtk_<ctrl>_on<event>`` 在事务构建期间默认监听 ``XTK_EVENT_PHASE_MASK_TARGET`` 阶段："

#: ../../source/imperative/events.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Phase-aware transaction subscriptions**: ``xtk_txn_on`` lets you listen"
" on any ``XtkEventId`` across ``XTK_EVENT_PHASE_MASK_CAPTURE`` (root down"
" to parent), ``XTK_EVENT_PHASE_MASK_TARGET``, "
"``XTK_EVENT_PHASE_MASK_BUBBLE`` (parent up to root), or "
"``XTK_EVENT_PHASE_MASK_ALL``:"
msgstr ""
"**指定传播阶段的事务订阅** ： ``xtk_txn_on`` 支持对任意 ``XtkEventId`` 选择 ``XTK_EVENT_PHASE_MASK_CAPTURE`` "
"（从根向父节点下传）、 ``XTK_EVENT_PHASE_MASK_TARGET`` 、 ``XTK_EVENT_PHASE_MASK_BUBBLE`` （从父节点向根冒泡）或 ``XTK_EVENT_PHASE_MASK_ALL`` ："

#: ../../source/imperative/events.rst:34
msgid ""
"If you plan to unsubscribe dynamically later with ``xtk_txn_off(&txn, "
"sub_id)``, map ``sub`` to its ``XtkSubId`` via ``result->subscriptions`` "
"after commit."
msgstr "若后续需要用 ``xtk_txn_off(&txn, sub_id)`` 动态取消订阅，可在提交后从 ``result->subscriptions`` 将 ``sub`` 映射为持久 ``XtkSubId`` 。"

#: ../../source/imperative/events.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Direct host subscriptions**: ``flux_host_subscribe`` and "
"``flux_host_unsubscribe`` attach or remove listeners directly on a "
"committed ``XtkCtrl`` outside a transaction."
msgstr "**宿主级直接订阅** ： ``flux_host_subscribe`` 与 ``flux_host_unsubscribe`` 可在事务外直接对已提交的 ``XtkCtrl`` 增删监听器。"

#: ../../source/imperative/events.rst:43
msgid ""
"The host borrows your ``void *arg`` (``userdata``) pointer until the "
"subscription is removed (via ``xtk_txn_off``, ``flux_host_unsubscribe``, "
"or dropping the target control's subtree) or ``flux_host_destroy`` runs. "
"Keep ``arg`` alive in your ``App`` struct or a page-scoped arena until "
"after the control is dropped."
msgstr ""
"宿主会持续借用传入的 ``void *arg`` （ ``userdata`` ）指针，直至该订阅被移除（调用 ``xtk_txn_off`` 、 "
"``flux_host_unsubscribe`` 或销毁目标控件所在子树）或 ``flux_host_destroy`` 执行完毕。"
"请将 ``arg`` 保存在 ``App`` 结构体或页面级内存池中，在控件销毁提交后再释放。"

