msgid ""
"``event->source`` / ``event->target`` / ``event->current_target`` — "
"Identify which ``XtkCtrl`` originated the event and which ancestor "
"listener is currently running."
msgstr "``event->source`` / ``event->target`` / ``event->current_target`` —— 标识触发事件的源控件 ``XtkCtrl`` 以及当前正在执行回调的节点。"

