msgid ""
"``event->cause`` — Distinguishes ``XTK_EVENT_CAUSE_USER``, ``PROGRAM``, "
"``BINDING``, and ``ACCESSIBILITY``."
msgstr "``event->cause`` —— 区分事件触发来源： ``XTK_EVENT_CAUSE_USER`` 、 ``PROGRAM`` 、 ``BINDING`` 或 ``ACCESSIBILITY`` 。"

