#: ../../source/imperative/events.rst:104
msgid ""
"Return ``XTK_EVENT_HANDLED`` when your callback handles the event, "
"combine ``XTK_EVENT_STOP_PROPAGATION`` or ``XTK_EVENT_STOP_IMMEDIATE`` to"
" halt bubbling, or return ``XTK_EVENT_CONTINUE`` (``0``) to let routing "
"proceed."
msgstr ""
"事件处理完毕返回 ``XTK_EVENT_HANDLED`` ；如需停止向祖先节点冒泡可按位或上 ``XTK_EVENT_STOP_PROPAGATION`` "
"或 ``XTK_EVENT_STOP_IMMEDIATE`` ；返回 ``XTK_EVENT_CONTINUE`` （ ``0`` ）则继续常规路由。"

