msgid "Frame-Coalesced UI Synchronization"
msgstr "按帧合并的 UI 同步模式"

#: ../../source/imperative/events.rst:111
msgid ""
"Decoupling state updates from scene mutations with ``flux_app_onframe`` "
"coalesces multiple input events within a single vsync interval into one "
"clean UI update:"
msgstr "通过 ``flux_app_onframe`` 将业务状态更新与场景属性写入解耦，可以把单个垂直同步周期内的多次输入事件合并为一次干净的界面更新："

#: ../../source/imperative/events.rst:148
msgid "Controlled Inputs & ``XtkChangeStamp``"
msgstr "受控输入与 ``XtkChangeStamp`` 变更戳"

#: ../../source/imperative/events.rst:150
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Every property write takes an ``XtkChangeStamp { XtkSourceId source; "
"uint64_t revision; }``:"
msgstr "所有属性写入函数都接收一个 ``XtkChangeStamp { XtkSourceId source; uint64_t revision; }`` 参数："

#: ../../source/imperative/events.rst:152
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Programmatic writes to outputs or external resets**: Pass "
"``(XtkChangeStamp) {0}`` (where ``source == 0`` and ``revision == 0``). "
"This authoritatively sets the control's property—use it when updating "
"output labels, toggling buttons, or clearing a ``TextBox`` from a "
"\"Reset\" button."
msgstr ""
"**对输出控件的程序写入或外部重置** ：传入 ``(XtkChangeStamp) {0}`` （即 ``source == 0`` 且 ``revision == 0`` ）。"
"这会直接覆盖控件属性值——适用于更新输出文本标签、切换按钮状态，或点击“重置”按钮清空 ``TextBox`` 。"

#: ../../source/imperative/events.rst:156
msgid ""
"**Controlled two-way echo**: When a user types into a ``TextBox``, the "
"emitted ``XtkEvent`` carries a non-zero ``event->change`` stamp generated"
" by the control. If your architecture echoes every model value back to "
"the input control on ``on_frame``, forwarding that ``event->change`` "
"stamp tells the host which edit revision your echo corresponds to—so "
"newer keystrokes or active IME composition in flight on the control are "
"preserved cleanly. In imperative code, updating the ``TextBox`` solely on"
" external actions (such as a \"Reset\" button) keeps ``on_name_change`` "
"even simpler because the control already displays the user's live edits."
msgstr ""
"**受控双向回显** ：用户在 ``TextBox`` 中输入时，触发的 ``XtkEvent`` 带有该控件生成的非零 ``event->change`` 变更戳。"
"若架构在 ``on_frame`` 中把模型值统一回写给输入框，原样转发该 ``event->change`` 即可告知宿主本次回显对应的编辑版本，"
"从而完好保留控件上更新的按键输入与正在进行的输入法组字。在纯命令式代码中，仅在外部动作（如“重置”按钮）时修改 ``TextBox`` "
"会让 ``on_name_change`` 更加直接，因为控件本身已经实时展示了用户的输入。"
